    "作业集中在一个版块中，并通过标签切换，避免题目、答案和视频材料同时挤满页面。沿岸俘获波视频与 19 页课件共同组成 Video Story。": "Assignments are grouped in one section and switched with tabs so questions, answers, and video materials do not crowd the page. The coastally trapped wave video and its 19-slide deck form one Video Story.",
