    "课程内容 · 从观测到动力解释": "Course Content · From Observations to Dynamical Interpretation",
    "教材图片库和出门票都属于课程内容；知识组织遵循“观测 → 状态变量 → 主导平衡 → 波动与环流 → 复习检索”。": "The textbook figure library and exit tickets both belong to course content. Knowledge is organized as observations → state variables → dominant balances → waves and circulation → retrieval practice.",
    "课堂概念与问答": "Classroom Concepts and Q&A",
